@page "/"

<PageTitle>YouTube Bulk Uploader</PageTitle>

<h1>YouTube Bulk Uploader</h1>

<p>
    Queue up an entire folder of videos and this app will upload them to your YouTube channel
    automatically, respecting YouTube's ~15-upload-per-24-hours limit &mdash; it uploads until it
    hits the cap, then waits and resumes on its own.
</p>

<ol>
    <li>
        <a href="/setup">Connect your Google account</a> (one-time setup, needs a Google Cloud OAuth client).
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="/queue">Point the Upload Queue at a folder</a> and start uploading.
    </li>
</ol>
